Package: oocpuinfo
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: HARDWARE CPU TOPOLOGY & INSTRUCTION SET INSPECTION ENGINE
 Decodes CPU microarchitecture, flags (AVX512, AES, etc.), cache sizes, and bugs.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 /proc/cpuinfo and sysfs parser, topology map, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
